---
title: Canvas
description: Working with nodes and connections on the pipeline canvas.
order: 1
---

Everything you do with nodes and cables on the pipeline canvas.

## Nodes

Drag a node from the sidebar onto the canvas, or right click the canvas to add one where the cursor is.

## Connections

Drag from an output handle to an input handle to route audio. Each cable carries the channels you picked.

### Channels

Hold Option to pick several channels at once and connect them as one cable.

## Selection

Select nodes to move, copy or delete them together. See the pages below for the shortcuts.
